{"id":28262,"author":"OCDs","body":"\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003eMinecraft Username: OCDs (This is JoinTheLogang, i have made this \"alt\" my main)\u0026nbsp;\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003eDiscord ID: Rocky#8427\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003eIn 1 or 2 sentences, tell me who you are:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;I am a 16 year old that keeps going to achieve my goals. I like to problem solve and use communication to tackle problems!\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003eWhat is your Planet Minecraft account? (If you do not have one, put N/A) OCDs\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003eWhat is your reddit account? (If you do not have one, put N/A) MyOCDTriggersMe\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003eHave you ever advertised a Minecraft server before?\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003eIf yes above, please describe of what you did and the challenges you faced.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003eAlthough i didn't directly advertise the server, i am organising an official tournament for the Pagoda UHC Network. This took a lot careful consideration as i had to spread the word about a new server without breaking advertisement rules anywhere. I got a round this obstacle by contacting a friend of mine who has a competitive minecraft discord server which has hosted past tournaments. This server has hundreds of people on so with permission i used good communication to get the hype around this tournament to reach new levels!\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003eWhat ideas/help can you bring to this team?\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003eI hope to bring a fresh start to the team as i know it hasnt been achieving as much as i thought it could. I would like to join this team to keep pushing people and to keep motivation to a max. I believe i would take a leading role compared to others as my natural instinct is to keep everyone moving as a team so there is no one falling behind.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003eHow active are you/how is your work ethic?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003eDue to me leading a team i have to keep discord activity constant and high. Although i am sometimes on my phone when i check it i have access to a lot of things on my phone so it wouldn't be a problem.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003eMy work ethic is very strong and i keep it this way by a variety of factors. First off, a sense of responsibility. If i understand what i am doing helps others complete jobs or has a positive influence then i realise i have a responsibility to abide by so i keep working. Secondly my sense of team work, after all this is the social media 'team' so upmost teamwork should be used so everyone can work to their maximum level. I know my communication is strong and that in turn keeps my team work strong. These few factors make my work ethic very appealing.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e","body_tagged":"\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003eMinecraft Username: OCDs (This is JoinTheLogang, i have made this \"alt\" my main)\u0026nbsp;\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003eDiscord ID: Rocky#8427\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin